{
  "id": "1CH.28",
  "number": "28",
  "bookId": "1CH",
  "reference": "1 Amakuru 28",
  "verseCount": 21,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "28",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "1CH 28"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "28",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 28:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omukama Daudi aragira abatwazi bona ba Isiraeli, abakuru b'enganda, abakuru b'ezamu abamukoleraga, abakuru b'enkumi, abakuru b'ebikumi, abagelezi b'eitunga lyona n'ebitunganwa by'omukama n'abanabe, hamoi n'abaramata, abashaija emanzi n'abarashani bona emanzi kwija Yerusalemu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.28.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.28.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 28:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho ayemelera agamba ati, “Barumuna bange mara ihanga lyange mumpulilize. Omu mutima gwange ntura n'inyenda kwombekera Esanduku y'Endagano y'Omukama Rwensinga ekahumura na Ruhanga waitu agire obusingiro, n'elyombeka nalitekatekire. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.28.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.28.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 28:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kyonkai Ruhanga akangambira ati, ‘Tonyombekere Rwensinga ahakuba oba mwisherukale kandi oraisire abantu.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.28.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.28.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 28:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi okwo Omukama Ruhanga wa Isiraeli akandonda omu ka ya tata yona kuba mukama wa Isiraeli eirai lyona; aha rw'okuba akaronka Yuda kuba mutwazi, n'omu ruganda rwa Yuda yaronkamu eka ya tata, n'omu ruzaro rwa tata yaronkamu inye kuba mukama wa Isiraeli yona. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.28.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.28.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 28:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omu bana bange bona b'abojo (enshonga Omukama antungire abana b'abojo bangi) aronkiremu Solomoni mutabani wange kugya aha nketo y'Omukama kutwara Isiraeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.28.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.28.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 28:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Angambiire ati, ‘Mutabani wawe Solomoni niwe alinyombekera Rwensinga, kuba muronkire kuba mwana wange, nanye ndiba ishe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.28.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.28.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 28:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Obukamabwe ndibuhamisa eirai lyona k'alimaza akekomya emihango yange n'emigenzo yange nk'okw'ali mwaha.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.28.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.28.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 28:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aha rw'ekyo nimbaragira omu maisho g'AbaIsiraeli bona, enteko y'Omukama, na Ruhanga nahulira, muhikye emihango yona y'Omukama Ruhanga wanyu mara mugigumeho. Aho nirwo mulilya ensi nungi egi, mukagisikisa n'abana banyu abalibasikira ebiro byona.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.28.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.28.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 28:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.28.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.28.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 28:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Kandi iwe Solomoni, omanye Ruhanga wa sho, omukolere n'omutima gwawe gwona n'obweyendezi bw'amagezi gawe, kuba Ruhanga amanya ebili omu mutima gwa buli muntu, ashoborora buli ntegeka na buli kitekelezo. K'olimuhiga olimubona, kyonkai k'olimwebwa na wenene alikuhwamu eirai lyona. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.28.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.28.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 28:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kityonu oramanya; Omukama akuronkire k'omwombekera Rwensinga ntakatifu. Obe manzi, ogyombeke.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.28.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.28.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 28:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.28.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.28.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 28:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho Daudi aha Solomoni omutabani eramani y'ekishasi kya Rwensinga n'amaju gayo, esitoa zayo, ebiyumba eby'eiguru n'eby'omunda, n'ekiyumba ky'entebe y'obuganyizi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.28.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.28.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 28:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amuha n'eramani y'ebyo yabaire nategeka byona ahali nyakabuga za Rwensinga y'Omukama, ebiyumba byona eby'obuzingora, esitoa za Rwensinga n'ez'ebihongo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.28.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.28.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 28:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amuha entwaza z'ezamu z'abakuhani n'Abalevita, n'ez'eikora lyona lya Rwensinga. Amuha n'entwaza z'ebikwato by'eikora omuli Rwensinga omwo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.28.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.28.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 28:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amulengera ezahabu ey'okukoza ebikwato byona by'ezahabu ebya buli muruka, amulengera n'efeza ey'okukoza ebikwato by'efeza; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.28.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.28.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 28:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "amulengera ebinara by'ezahabu n'etara zabyo, amulengera ezahabu y'okukoza buli kinara n'etara zakyo, amulengera efeza y'okukoza ekinara n'etara zakyo kuhondera n'emikoleze ya buli kinara aha muruka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.28.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.28.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 28:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amulengera ezahabu y'okukoza buli meza y'okutekaho omukate gw'obusinge, n'efeza y'okukoza emeza z'efeza; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.28.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.28.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 28:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "n'ezahabu enchenkure y'okukoza euma, ebeseni n'ebikompe, amulengera n'efeza y'okukoza buli pakuli y'efeza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.28.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.28.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 28:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amulengera ealutare y'okwoteraho obunuma ekozibwe ezahabu ejugusire, n'ezahabu egyo agimulengera. Amulengera n'egali y'ezahabu ey'abakerubi abashanshurwire amapapa kushweka Esanduku y'Endagano y'Omukama. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.28.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.28.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 28:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ebi byona Daudi akabihandika yabishoborora bunyanungi nk'okwo Omukama yamuragiire. Yaragira eikora lyona kukorwa nk'okwo lyategekirwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.28.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.28.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 28:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.28.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.28.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 28:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ahanyuma agambira omutabani Solomoni ati, “Ogume mara omanzare, okore omulimo ogu. Otatina, kandi otahwahwana, kuba Omukama Ruhanga owo nkolera aina iwe. Takunagirane anga kukusigaho kuhika orwo omulimo gwona gw'elyombeka lya Rwensinga gulihwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.28.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.28.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 28:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abakuhani n'Abalevita bahairwe ezamu zabo za Rwensinga. Abakozi aba buli kabuya nibebuga kukujuna. Kandi abakuru n'eihanga lyona barakuhulira limoi limoi.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.28.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.28.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
